%U A398678 28235926125,57737128904,354184524867,724240365697,4442803706880,9084693297025,55729438704579,113956161827912,699056393895405
%N A398678 Number of spanning trees of the 3 X n grid graph that are invariant under reflection in the vertical axis.
%H A398678 Eric Weisstein's World of Mathematics, <a href="https://mathworld.wolfram.com/GridGraph.html">Grid Graph</a>.
%H A398678 Eric Weisstein's World of Mathematics, <a href="https://mathworld.wolfram.com/SpanningTree.html">Spanning Tree</a>.
%H A398678 <a href="/index/Rec#order_08">Index entries for linear recurrences with constant coefficients</a>, signature (0,15,0,-32,0,15,0,-1).
%F A398678 G.f.: x*(1 - x)*(1 + x)*(1 + 3*x - 6*x^2 + 3*x^3 + x^4)/(1 - 15*x^2 + 32*x^4 - 15*x^6 + x^8).
%F A398678 a(n) = 15*a(n-2) - 32*a(n-4) + 15*a(n-6) - a(n-8).
%F A398678 a(n) = A003775((n-1)/2) for odd n; a(n) = 3*A006238(n/2) for even n.
%e A398678 For n = 2, a(2) = 3. The three spanning trees of a 3 X 2 grid graph that are fixed under reflection across the vertical axis are:
%e A398678    +   +   +   +   +---+
%e A398678    |   |   |   |   |   |
%e A398678    +---+   +   +   +   +
%e A398678    |   |   |   |   |   |
%e A398678    +   +   +---+   +   +
%t A398678 LinearRecurrence[{0,15,0,-32,0,15,0,-1},{1,3,8,45,95,576,1183,7245},30]
